\title{Microarch semantics, core/libc fixes, and extraction of all 88 \code{\verb~|binary32~} kernels}
\taxon{Change}
\date{2026-11-25}
\author{antigravity}
\contributor{schrodingerzy}
\tag{changelog}
\tag{extraction}
\tag{microarch}
\tag{difftest}
\import{base-macros}

\p{Landed in 18 linear semantic commits (\code{\verb~|920dce9~} through \code{\verb~|2427212~}) during session [ses-BUYJ](ses-BUYJ). The complete proof \code{\verb~|expfDoubleEval_correctlyRounded~} remains intact with zero \code{\verb~|sorry~}.}
\ul{
\li{\strong{Project rules in \code{\verb~|AGENTS.md~} (\code{\verb~|920dce9~}).} Recorded Conventional Commits, ASD-STE100 prose rules, \code{\verb~|difftest~} verification for every extracted kernel, and external kernel verification with \code{\verb~|gruszka/con-leche~}.}
\li{\strong{Performance and \code{\verb~|LibcMath/Libc/~} completion (\code{\verb~|7ea589d~}, \code{\verb~|8ce4460~}, \code{\verb~|d0477a1~}, \code{\verb~|c8a1411~}, \code{\verb~|abe699d~}).} Marked FloatLib arithmetic wrappers \code{\verb~|@[noinline]~} for a 32x C codegen reduction ([ins-L00D](ins-L00D)). Added microarchitecture \code{\verb~|MathConfig~} ISA presets and proved microarch theorems in \code{\verb~|LibcMath/Libc/Microarch.lean~}. Added accuracy-pass operations, \code{\verb~|NormalFloat~}, NaN payloads, array \code{\verb~|BigInt~} limbs, and exact \code{\verb~|FPBits.exponent~} and \code{\verb~|intlogb~} semantics.}
\li{\strong{Extractor upgrades (\code{\verb~|b511236~}, \code{\verb~|5f5ddb2~}, \code{\verb~|cc13976~}, \code{\verb~|b499058~}, \code{\verb~|763dbca~}).} Extended \code{\verb~|ast2lean~} with microarch macro capture, structs, out and in-out reference parameters, generic lambdas, \code{\verb~|Option~}-monad loops, \code{\verb~|__builtin_unreachable~}, compound-assignment LHS widths, and multi-step \code{\verb~|for~} increments ([ins-Y83Z](ins-Y83Z)).}
\li{\strong{FloatLib specs and generic \code{\verb~|difftest~} (\code{\verb~|7efac05~}).} Wrapped FloatLib transcendental and algebraic specifications in \code{\verb~|LibcMath/Testing/Oracle/FloatLib.lean~}. Added \code{\verb~|test/difftest/F32Model.lean~}, \code{\verb~|f32_native.cpp~}, and \code{\verb~|scripts/difftest-f32.sh~}.}
\li{\strong{All 88 \code{\verb~|binary32~} kernels extracted and difftested (\code{\verb~|f13aaf7~}, \code{\verb~|b73a293~}, \code{\verb~|63fc8b1~}, \code{\verb~|7307aab~}, \code{\verb~|ae04727~}, \code{\verb~|2427212~}).} Extracted 166 evaluation and microarch plans across exponential, log/root/power, trigonometric, hyperbolic/special, basic/rounding/extrema, and IEEE families. Each unproved theorem uses explicit \code{\verb~|sorry~} and \code{\verb~|#guard_msgs in #print axioms~}, tracked in \code{\verb~|OPEN.md~} (160 open obligations). Every native plan passes \code{\verb~|difftest~} with zero mismatches; upstream \code{\verb~|exp2m1f~} negative-NaN UB is proved in Lean ([prob-X3VQ](prob-X3VQ)).}
}
